  "content": "<div><br></div><div><!--StartFragment--><table class=\"ve-w-100 ve-stats ve-stats--book ve-stats--bkmv\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; background: rgb(34, 34, 34); width: 354.25px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12.6px; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.176) 0px 6px 12px; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-stats__th-name ve-text-left ve-pb-0 \" colspan=\"6\" data-name=\"Cape of the Mountebank\" data-page=\"items.html\" data-source=\"XDMG\" data-hash=\"cape%20of%20the%20mountebank_xdmg\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; position: relative; font-size: 1.8em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-caps: small-caps; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-weight: 500; padding-left: 0.2em !important; text-align: left !important;\"><div class=\"ve-split-v-end\" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important; align-items: flex-end !important;\"><div class=\"ve-flex-v-center\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: center !important;\"><h1 class=\"ve-stats__h-name ve-copyable ve-m-0\" onmousedown=\"event.preventDefault()\" onclick=\"Renderer.utils._pHandleNameClick(this)\" style=\"font-size: unset; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: unset; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); cursor: copy !important;\">Cape of the Mountebank</h1></div><div class=\"ve-stats__wrp-h-source  ve-flex-v-baseline\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: baseline !important;\"><br></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-rd-item__type-rarity-attunement\" colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-flex-col\" style=\"display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important;\"><div class=\"ve-split \" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important;\"><div class=\"ve-italic\" style=\"font-style: italic !important;\">Wondrous Item, Rare</div></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-py-0\" style=\"padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pb-2\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--2\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">This cape smells faintly of brimstone. While wearing it, you can use it to cast Dimension Door as a Magic action. This property can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>When you teleport with that spell, you leave behind a cloud of smoke. The space you left is Lightly Obscured by that smoke until the end of your next turn.</p></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table><!--EndFragment--></div><div><br></div><div><!--StartFragment--><table id=\"pagecontent\" class=\"ve-w-100 ve-stats\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; background: rgb(34, 34, 34); width: 463.328px; font-family: Convergence, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.6px; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-stats__th-name ve-text-left ve-pb-0 \" colspan=\"6\" data-name=\"Dimension Door\" data-page=\"spells.html\" data-source=\"XPHB\" data-hash=\"dimension%20door_xphb\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; position: relative; font-size: 1.8em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-variant: small-caps; font-weight: 500; padding-left: 0.2em !important; text-align: left !important;\"><div class=\"ve-split-v-end\" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important; align-items: flex-end !important;\"><div class=\"ve-flex-v-center\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: center !important;\"><h1 class=\"ve-stats__h-name ve-copyable ve-m-0\" onmousedown=\"event.preventDefault()\" onclick=\"Renderer.utils._pHandleNameClick(this)\" style=\"font-size: unset; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: unset; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); cursor: copy !important;\">Dimension Door</h1></div><div class=\"ve-stats__wrp-h-source  ve-flex-v-baseline\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: baseline !important;\"><br></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><i>Level 4 Conjuration</i><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pt-2\" style=\"padding-right: 4px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 4px; padding-top: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Casting Time:&nbsp;</span>Action<span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Range:&nbsp;</span>500 feet<span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Components:&nbsp;</span>V<span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pb-2\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Duration:&nbsp;</span>Instantaneous<span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px;\">You teleport to a location within range. You arrive at exactly the spot desired. It can be a place you can see, one you can visualize, or one you can describe by stating distance and direction, such as \"200 feet straight downward\" or \"300 feet upward to the northwest at a 45-degree angle.\"</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px;\">You can also teleport one willing creature. The creature must be within 5 feet of you when you teleport, and it teleports to a space within 5 feet of your destination space.</p><p>If you, the other creature, or both would arrive in a space occupied by a creature or completely filled by one or more objects, you and any creature traveling with you each take&nbsp;<span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll a critical hit, CTRL to half damage (rounding down).\" onmousedown=\"event.preventDefault()\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;4d6&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;4d6&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;damage&quot;}\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">4d6&nbsp;</span>Force damage, and the teleportation fails.</p></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table><!--EndFragment--></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
